    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "A shop had three employees. The manager received $\\$976$ per week and the senior assistant received $\\$654$ per week. The junior assistant earned $\\$443$ per week. What was the total weekly wages bill for the shop?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$2073$ per week",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{array}{rrrrr}&&9&7&6\\\\&&6&5&4\\\\+&&4&4&3\\\\\\hline&2&0&7&3\\\\\\hline\\end{array}$$\nCarry 1 ten from the ones column and 1 hundred from the tens column. The total weekly wages bill was $\\$2073$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
